-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11429\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f6d104 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4f6d104\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1310263 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1310263\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. The audit is useful for in-house ecommerce, digital, and product teams.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11430\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"31\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11430\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Does using the audit commit me to anything? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11430\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2163781 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2163781\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7cd3e07 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7cd3e07\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No. There are no strings attached.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11431\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"32\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11431\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What happens after the audit? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11431\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe9c419 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fe9c419\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e21a723 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e21a723\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can review the results, share them with your team, and use them to prioritise improvements in your product data and Shopping setup.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11432\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"33\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11432\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Will FeedOps contact me after I sign up? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11432\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35489b1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"35489b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24e96eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"24e96eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We may contact you to help set up access or support your use of the audit, but you are not required to upgrade to FeedOps.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11433\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"34\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11433\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Can I share audit access with clients or stakeholders? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11433\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-286423f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"286423f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc3ef5c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cc3ef5c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes. You can invite relevant team members and stakeholders to review audit results.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11434\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"35\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11434\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Is this only for large retailers? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11434\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f811152 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f811152\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b7075c0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b7075c0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No. The audit can be used by growing ecommerce businesses, established brands, large retailers, and agencies.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11435\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"36\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11435\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Does this work for one Merchant Center account or many? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11435\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-077f45a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"077f45a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dd28a38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dd28a38\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It can be used across multiple websites and accounts, which makes it useful for both in-house teams and agencies.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11436\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"37\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11436\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What makes this different from a manual audit? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11436\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-918bfad e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"918bfad\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf76801 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bf76801\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A manual audit often relies on spot checks and opinion. This audit is fully automated, covers your full catalogue, and gives you a repeatable way to assess feed health over time.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11437\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"38\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11437\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Do I have to upgrade to FeedOps to act on the findings? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11437\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-03fa92d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"03fa92d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c9b1cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3c9b1cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No. You can use the audit on its own. Upgrading is optional.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-11438\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"39\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-11438\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What happens if I want FeedOps to help fix the issues? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-11438\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0070695 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0070695\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a5b058 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9a5b058\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you choose to upgrade to a FeedOps plan with optimisation, FeedOps can then help you take action on the findings.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\\/\\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this really free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The Google Shopping Feed Audit is completely free to use.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it fully automated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The audit is fully automated. Once your account is set up and your Google Merchant Center is connected, the platform reviews your product data automatically.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to become a FeedOps customer?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. You do not need to become a FeedOps customer to use the audit.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to replace my current feed provider?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. You can keep your existing feed provider and still use the audit.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to connect Google Ads?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The audit does not require a Google Ads connection. It uses Google Merchant Center as the source of truth.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why does the audit use Google Merchant Center?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Google Merchant Center contains the product data that powers your Google Shopping presence. That makes it the best place to assess visibility, completeness, and potential issues.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does the audit make changes to Google Merchant Center?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The audit is read-only. It does not make any changes to your Google Merchant Center account or product data.FeedOps only makes changes if you choose to upgrade to a plan that includes optimisation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is this for?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The audit is built for retailers, brands, ecommerce teams, and agencies that want a clearer view of product data health in Google Shopping.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are retailers welcome?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Retailers are welcome. Whether you manage one website or many, the audit is designed to help you understand what may be limiting performance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are brands welcome?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Brands are welcome. The audit can help you understand how your product data is performing across your catalogue.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are agencies welcome?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Agencies are welcome. You can use the audit across multiple client websites and invite your team members as needed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I run more than one audit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can run as many audits as you like.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use it on more than one website?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can run audits across as many websites as you like.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I invite my team?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can invite all your team members so they can access and review audits with you.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I store past audits?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Past audits are stored, so you can review earlier results and compare progress over time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this a one-off report?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. This is not a one-off report. You can run audits regularly and keep a history of results.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does the audit check?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The audit checks key product data signals that may affect Google Shopping performance, including visibility score, products with impressions but no clicks, products with no impressions, and attribute completeness.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Visibility Score?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Visibility Score helps you understand how visible your catalogue is likely to be across Google Shopping surfaces.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are Zombie Products?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Zombie Products are products that get impressions but do not get clicks. They may be showing, but they are not attracting enough shopper interest.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does No Impressions, No Clicks mean?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"This highlights products that are not being seen at all. That can point to issues with product data, relevance, completeness, or overall visibility.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Attribute Completeness?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Attribute Completeness shows whether important product data fields are present and complete. Missing or weak attributes can reduce visibility and relevance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does the audit help with both paid and organic visibility?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The audit helps you identify issues that may affect both paid Shopping activity and free listings.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will the audit tell me what is holding my product data back?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. That is the purpose of the audit. It is designed to help you quickly identify weak signals, missing data, and missed opportunities.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What makes this audit different?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"This audit gives you complete SKU coverage across your catalogue.It does not rely on subjective opinions or spot checks. It uses algorithms and AI to assess your product data consistently, at scale, and in a repeatable way.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need technical skills to use it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The audit is designed to be simple to use and easy to understand.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I get access?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Sign up with your work email, and we will set up your account.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why do I need to use a work email?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We use work emails to help keep access relevant for real businesses, brands, retailers, and agencies.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does setup take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Once you sign up, we set up your account so you can get started as soon as access is ready.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use the audit even if I already have an agency?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Many businesses use the audit alongside their existing agency or internal team.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use the audit if I manage feeds in-house?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The audit is useful for in-house ecommerce, digital, and product teams.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does using the audit commit me to anything?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. There are no strings attached.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens after the audit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can review the results, share them with your team, and use them to prioritise improvements in your product data and Shopping setup.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will FeedOps contact me after I sign up?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We may contact you to help set up access or support your use of the audit, but you are not required to upgrade to FeedOps.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I share audit access with clients or stakeholders?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can invite relevant team members and stakeholders to review audit results.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this only for large retailers?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The audit can be used by growing ecommerce businesses, established brands, large retailers, and agencies.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does this work for one Merchant Center account or many?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It can be used across multiple websites and accounts, which makes it useful for both in-house teams and agencies.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What makes this different from a manual audit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A manual audit often relies on spot checks and opinion. This audit is fully automated, covers your full catalogue, and gives you a repeatable way to assess feed health over time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I have to upgrade to FeedOps to act on the findings?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. You can use the audit on its own. Upgrading is optional.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens if I want FeedOps to help fix the issues?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"If you choose to upgrade to a FeedOps plan with optimisation, FeedOps can then help you take action on the findings.\"}}]}<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c48723 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7c48723\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a33e0ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"a33e0ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>\n.elementor-nav-menu {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center; \n  justify-content: space-between !important;\n  width: 71%;\n}\n.elementor-nav-menu:after {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n.elementor-sticky--active{\n    display: none;;\n}\n<\/style>\n<script>\nwindow.addEventListener('load', () => {\n  const menus = document.querySelectorAll('.elementor-nav-menu');\n\n  menus.forEach(navMenu => {\n    \/\/ Clear existing items\n    navMenu.innerHTML = '';\n\n    \/\/ FAQ item\n    const faqItem = document.createElement('li');\n    faqItem.className = 'menu-item';\n    faqItem.innerHTML = `<a href=\"#faq\" class=\"elementor-item\">FAQ<\/a>`;\n\n    \/\/ Button item\n    const buttonItem = document.createElement('li');\n    buttonItem.className = 'menu-item';\n    buttonItem.innerHTML = `\n      <a href=\"#request-access\" class=\"elementor-item\" style=\"\n        background:#FFC107;\n        padding:10px 20px;\n        border-radius:6px;\n        color:#000;\n        font-weight:600;\n        margin-left:10px;\n        display:inline-block;\n      \">\n        Get Free Access\n      <\/a>\n    `;\n\n    \/\/ Append both\n    navMenu.appendChild(faqItem);\n    navMenu.appendChild(buttonItem);\n  });\n});\n<\/script>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62d48ba e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"62d48ba\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4743525 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4743525\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c6fe5a4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c6fe5a4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-37f68da elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"37f68da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">See What Your Product Data Is Missing<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d78918d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d78918d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get free access to the <\/span><b>fully automated<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Google Shopping Feed Audit and start finding the issues that may be holding back visibility, clicks, and conversions.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26ee471 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"26ee471\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5016760 elementor-align-center elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"5016760\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#request-access\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Get Free Access<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f84adb elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f84adb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Work emails only.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Expert Authority Free Google Shopping Feed Audit Use the Free Google Shopping Feed Audit to connect your Google Merchant Center and see what is holding back your product visibility, clicks, and conversions. This fully automated audit reviews your Google Shopping feed data to uncover missed opportunities, weak product signals, and gaps that may be limiting [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5708","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Free Google Shopping Feed Audit - FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Use the Free Google Shopping Feed Audit to connect your Google Merchant Center and see what is holding back your product visibility, clicks, and conversions. This fully automated audit reviews your Google Shopping feed data to uncover missed opportunities, weak product signals, and gaps that may be limiting both paid and organic performance.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/free-google-shopping-feed-audit\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Free Google Shopping Feed Audit\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Use the Free Google Shopping Feed Audit to connect your Google Merchant Center and see what is holding back your product visibility, clicks, and conversions. This fully automated audit reviews your Google Shopping feed data to uncover missed opportunities, weak product signals, and gaps that may be limiting both paid and organic performance.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/free-google-shopping-feed-audit\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.faceboo